Hi Randall,

Thanks again for the conversation on Tuesday. The team was really
impressed with what you have built at Unbaitable Training Co., and they
would like to move you to the technical stage.

The assessment is a small C# exercise that mirrors the tooling the
awareness team uses day to day. It should take around two hours.

1. Extract the attached archive (password: Brightline2026).
2. Open Assessment.sln in Visual Studio and build the solution once.
   The build registers your candidate ID with our harness, and we
   cannot score a submission without it.
3. Complete the TODO items in ReportParser.cs.
4. Zip the folder and reply to this email.

We are holding this slot for you until end of day Friday, as the panel
reviews submissions in order. Please keep the materials to yourself,
since we reuse the same exercise for other candidates.

Happy to answer any questions.

Best regards,
Emily Carter
Senior Technical Recruiter
Brightline Security Partners
